{"unit_id":"Jiyr0119__dsh-service-console#feature-scan","repo":"Jiyr0119/dsh-service-console","commit":"836e20c8d680a4d88ce357260b3ebaa00becd8c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Service Console 的功能「扫描监听服务」：发现本机正在监听的 TCP 端口，并读取对应进程、命令、工作目录和启动信息。打开面板获取快照，用户可主动刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/process-inspector.ts:139-180","src/host/service-registry.ts:18-68"]}
{"unit_id":"Jiyr0119__dsh-service-console#feature-ownership","repo":"Jiyr0119/dsh-service-console","commit":"836e20c8d680a4d88ce357260b3ebaa00becd8c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Service Console 的功能「识别服务归属」：将服务与会话启动台账、工作区路径匹配，并显示会话确认、工作区推断、本机其他、未知或受保护等归属状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/ownership.ts:14-50","src/host/service-registry.ts:41-60"]}
{"unit_id":"Jiyr0119__dsh-service-console#feature-stop","repo":"Jiyr0119/dsh-service-console","commit":"836e20c8d680a4d88ce357260b3ebaa00becd8c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Service Console 的功能「停止服务」：从面板对选中的可操作服务发起停止，先向进程组发送 SIGTERM 并等待其退出；只有设置允许时才会在超时后强制终止。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/lifecycle.ts:22-47"]}
{"unit_id":"Jiyr0119__dsh-service-console#feature-restart","repo":"Jiyr0119/dsh-service-console","commit":"836e20c8d680a4d88ce357260b3ebaa00becd8c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Service Console 的功能「重启服务」：对有会话启动记录且可重启的服务，先执行停止，再用记录的工作目录和命令重新启动；缺少记录时返回不可重启结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/lifecycle.ts:49-63"]}
